05 普及组] 陶陶摘苹果\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"超级基础的模拟题。\n依次判断陶陶的身高加板凳的高度（30 厘米）是否大于每一个苹果的高度，如果大于等于苹果的高度，则 ans++。\n代码：\n#include &amp;lt;bits/stdc++.h&amp;gt;\nusing namespace std;…\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:section\" content=\"题解\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:author\" content=\"Shuhang_JOKER1\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2025-08-06T16:37:14+08:00\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.luogu.com/article/d8583wuv\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"洛谷专栏\" />\n        <script id=\"luogu-theme\" type=\"application/json\">{\"id\":1,\"lNavi\":{\"back\":\"#ffffff\",\"fore\":\"#262626\",\"logo\":null},\"lBody\":{\"back\":\"#f0f4fa\",\"blur\":1000,\"fade\":1000,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/images\\/bg\\/fe\\/luogu4-bg-l.jpg\",\"midOpts\":{\"size\":\"cover\"}},\"dNavi\":{\"back\":\"#1d2025\",\"fore\":\"#ffffff\",\"logo\":\"#ffffff\"},\"dBody\":{\"back\":\"#0d1018\",\"blur\":1000,\"fade\":1000,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/images\\/bg\\/fe\\/luogu4-bg-d.jpg\",\"midOpts\":{\"size\":\"cover\"}}}</script>\n    <style></style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"app\">\n    <noscript>\n        <h3>请<b style=\"color:#f00;\">不要禁用</b>脚本，否则网页无法正常加载</h3>\n    </noscript>\n        <article>\n        <h1>题解：P1046 [NOIP 2005 普及组] 陶陶摘苹果</h1>\n        <p style=\"font-size: .75em;\">\n            <a rel=\"author\">Shuhang_JOKER1</a>\n            ·\n            <time datetime=\"2025-08-06T16:37:14+08:00\">2025-08-06 16:37:14</time>\n            ·\n            <a href=\"/article?category=2\">题解</a>\n        </p>\n\n        <p>超级基础的模拟题。</p>\n<p>依次判断陶陶的身高加板凳的高度（30 厘米）是否大于每一个苹果的高度，如果大于等于苹果的高度，则 ans++。</p>\n<p>代码：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">#include &lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;\nusing namespace std;\nint a[15],height,ans;\nint main(){\n    ios::sync_with_stdio(0);\n    cin.tie(0);\n    cout.tie(0);\n    for(int i=1;i&lt;=10;i++)//输入\n        cin&gt;&gt;a[i];\n    cin&gt;&gt;height;\n    for(int i=1;i&lt;=10;i++)//循环判断\n        if(height+30&gt;=a[i])//判断\n            ans++;//累加\n    cout&lt;&lt;ans&lt;&lt;endl;//输出\n    return 0;\n}</code></pre>\n    </article>\n</div>\n<script>(function(){function c(){var b=a.contentDocument||(a.contentWindow&&a.contentWindow.document);if(b){var d=b.createElement('script');d.innerHTML=\"window.__CF$cv$params={r:'a5ff11f87fecf328',t:'MTc5NTU5MzEwNw=='};var l=window.parent.location,o;try{o=new URL(l.origin).origin}catch(e){try{o=new URL(new URL(l.href).origin).origin}catch(e){o=''}}var u='/cdn-cgi/challenge-platform/scripts/jsd/main.js?ray=a5ff11f87fecf328',a=document.createElement('script');a.src=o?new URL(u,o).href:u;document.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(a);\";b.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(d)}}if(document.body){var a=document.createElement('iframe');a.height=1;a.width=1;a.style.position='absolute';a.style.top=0;a.style.left=0;a.style.border='none';a.style.visibility='hidden';document.body.appendChild(a);if('loading'!==document.readyState)c();else if(window.addEventListener)document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',c);else{var e=document.onreadystatechange||function(){};document.onreadystatechange=function(b){e(b);'loading'!==document.readyState&&(document.onreadystatechange=e,c())}}}})();</script></body>\n</html>\n",
